{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(_:issuppressed:)-40vcu"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogSuppressionToggle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"title","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StringProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The title of the suppression toggle in the dialog. This"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter can be elided to use the default suppression title.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"title"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the suppression toggle is on or off in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dialog."}]}],"name":"isSuppressed"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Applying dialog suppression adds a toggle to dialogs on Windows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which allows the user to request the alert not be displayed again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Typically whether a dialog is suppressed is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and used to decide whether to present the dialog in the future."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example configures an alert with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suppression toggle. The toggle’s state is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Delete Items” button is pressed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var isShowingDialog = false","    @AppStorage(\"suppressEraseItemAlert\")","    private var suppressAlert = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        Window(...) {","            Button(\"Delete items\") {","                isShowingDialog = true","            }","        }","","        AlertScene(","            \"Are you sure you want to erase these items?\",","            isPresented: $isShowingDialog","        ) {","            Button(\"Erase\", role: .destructive) {","                \/\/ Handle item deletion.","            }","            Button(\"Cancel\", role: .cancel) {","                \/\/ Handle cancellation","            }","        }","        .dialogSuppressionToggle(","            \"Do not ask about erasing items again\",","            isSuppressed: $suppressAlert)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dialogSuppressionToggle"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isSuppressed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE23dialogSuppressionToggle_12isSuppressedQrqd___AA7BindingVySbGtSyRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI11WindowGroupV","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables user suppression of an alert with a custom suppression"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)-40vcu","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","ur